# Architecture rules

- Monolith Next.js Route Handlers under `app/api/**`; domain logic in `lib/**`.
- SQLite only for MVP persistence (`DATABASE_PATH`).
- Gemini via thin `lib/llm` client + Zod; one repair retry on invalid JSON.
- Ingestion: SSRF-safe fetch + Readability; optional X API; paste fallback. Never fabricate page content.
- Writing: deterministic complex/passive/filler → non-overlap → LLM explain/rewrite.
- Draft original snapshot preserved separately from working sections.
- Validate evidence `sourceIds` against project sources.
